### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### List categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Accept: application/json

### Filter categories by type (alat/bahan)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories?type=alat
Accept: application/json

### Get single category
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/1
Accept: application/json

### Create category (equipment type)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Mikroskop",
  "type": "alat",
  "description": "Mikroskop optik dan elektron untuk pengamatan sampel"
}

### Create category (bahan tipo)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Bahan Kimia",
  "type": "bahan",
  "description": "Bahan-bahan kimia untuk penggunaan laboratorium"
}

### Update category
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Mikroskop Baru",
  "description": "Updated description"
}

### Delete category
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/1